"<image id=\"img_id3154020\" src=\"sd/res/imagelst/nv05.png\" width=\"0."
"222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"><alt id=\"alt_id3154020\""
">Պատկերակ</alt></image>"

#: 02160000.xhp#par_id3149965.29.help.text
#: 02160000.xhp%23par_id3149965.29.help.text
