"<image id=\"img_id3152948\" src=\"res/sc06300.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height="
"\"0.222in\"><alt id=\"alt_id3152948\">Պատկերակ</alt></image>"

#: 05040500.xhp#par_id3153540.49.help.text
#: 05040500.xhp%23par_id3153540.49.help.text
